        ],
        "title": "Multiple periods",
        "text": "$$\\tan(\\theta)$$ is $$2\\pi$$ periodic. It is also $$4\\pi$$ periodic. Its minimum period is $$\\pi.$$ Thus, $$\\tan(\\theta)$$ is also $$3\\pi$$ periodic as well.",
